---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden py-12 md:py-20">
    <!-- Background -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50 via-white to-emerald-50/50 -z-10"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-96 h-96 bg-green-200/20 rounded-full blur-3xl -z-10"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-96 h-96 bg-emerald-100/20 rounded-full blur-3xl -z-10"></div>
    
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="text-center mb-12 md:mb-16">
        <div class="inline-block bg-green-100/80 backdrop-blur-sm px-6 py-2 rounded-full mb-4">
          <span class="text-green-700 text-sm font-medium tracking-wider">🌿 SEJARAH & KRONOLOGI</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-green-800">
          Kronologi Pembuatan Ecobrick
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Langkah demi langkah mengubah sisa plastik menjadi bata ekologi yang lestari
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Timeline -->
      <div class="relative">
        <!-- Vertical line -->
        <div class="absolute left-4 md:left-1/2 top-0 bottom-0 w-1 bg-gradient-to-b from-green-400 via-green-500 to-emerald-600 transform -translate-x-1/2 hidden md:block"></div>
        <div class="absolute left-4 top-0 bottom-0 w-1 bg-gradient-to-b from-green-400 via-green-500 to-emerald-600 md:hidden"></div>
        
        <!-- Timeline items -->
        <div class="space-y-8 md:space-y-12">
          
          <!-- Item 1 -->
          <div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center gap-4 md:gap-8">
            <!-- Timeline dot -->
            <div class="absolute left-4 md:left-1/2 w-4 h-4 bg-green-500 rounded-full border-4 border-white shadow-lg transform -translate-x-1/2 z-10"></div>
            
            <!-- Content -->
            <div class="ml-12 md:ml-0 md:w-1/2 md:pr-8 md:text-right order-2 md:order-1">
              <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 border-l-4 border-green-500 md:border-l-0 md:border-r-4 hover:-translate-y-1">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 md:justify-end">
                  <span class="text-3xl">🗑️</span>
                  <span class="text-sm font-bold text-green-600 bg-green-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Langkah 1</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-800 mt-3">Pengumpulan Bahan</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-600 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
                  Kumpulkan botol plastik dan sisa plastik daripada aktiviti harian. Pastikan plastik bersih dan kering untuk diproses.
                </p>
                <div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2 md:justify-end">
                  <span class="text-xs bg-green-50 text-green-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">🥤 Botol PET</span>
                  <span class="text-xs bg-green-50 text-green-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">🫙 Penutup botol</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Empty spacer for desktop -->
            <div class="hidden md:block md:w-1/2 order-1 md:order-2"></div>
          </div>
          
          <!-- Item 2 -->
          <div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center gap-4 md:gap-8">
            <div class="absolute left-4 md:left-1/2 w-4 h-4 bg-green-500 rounded-full border-4 border-white shadow-lg transform -translate-x-1/2 z-10"></div>
            
            <div class="hidden md:block md:w-1/2 order-1"></div>
            
            <div class="ml-12 md:ml-0 md:w-1/2 md:pl-8 order-2">
              <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 border-l-4 border-green-500 hover:-translate-y-1">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                  <span class="text-3xl">🧹</span>
                  <span class="text-sm font-bold text-green-600 bg-green-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Langkah 2</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-800 mt-3">Pembersihan & Pengeringan</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-600 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
                  Bersihkan plastik dengan sabun dan air. Keringkan di bawah sinar matahari untuk memastikan tiada kelembapan.
                </p>
                <div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                  <span class="text-xs bg-green-50 text-green-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">🧼 Cuci bersih</span>
                  <span class="text-xs bg-green-50 text-green-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">☀️ Jemur 2-3 jam</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <!-- Item 3 -->
          <div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center gap-4 md:gap-8">
            <div class="absolute left-4 md:left-1/2 w-4 h-4 bg-green-500 rounded-full border-4 border-white shadow-lg transform -translate-x-1/2 z-10"></div>
            
            <div class="ml-12 md:ml-0 md:w-1/2 md:pr-8 md:text-right order-2 md:order-1">
              <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 border-l-4 border-green-500 md:border-l-0 md:border-r-4 hover:-translate-y-1">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 md:justify-end">
                  <span class="text-3xl">✂️</span>
                  <span class="text-sm font-bold text-green-600 bg-green-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Langkah 3</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-800 mt-3">Pemotongan & Pencincangan</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-600 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
                  Potong plastik kepada kepingan kecil. Gunakan gunting atau mesin pencincang untuk mendapatkan saiz yang seragam.
                </p>
                <div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2 md:justify-end">
                  <span class="text-xs bg-green-50 text-green-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">✂️ Potong kecil</span>
                  <span class="text-xs bg-green-50 text-green-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">📏 Saiz 1-2cm</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="hidden md:block md:w-1/2 order-1 md:order-2"></div>
          </div>
          
          <!-- Item 4 -->
          <div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center gap-4 md:gap-8">
            <div class="absolute left-4 md:left-1/2 w-4 h-4 bg-green-500 rounded-full border-4 border-white shadow-lg transform -translate-x-1/2 z-10"></div>
            
            <div class="hidden md:block md:w-1/2 order-1"></div>
            
            <div class="ml-12 md:ml-0 md:w-1/2 md:pl-8 order-2">
              <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 border-l-4 border-green-500 hover:-translate-y-1">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                  <span class="text-3xl">🍶</span>
                  <span class="text-sm font-bold text-green-600 bg-green-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Langkah 4</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-800 mt-3">Pengisian Botol</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-600 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
                  Masukkan plastik cincang ke dalam botol menggunakan kayu atau penekan. Padatkan sehingga botol keras dan padu.
                </p>
                <div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                  <span class="text-xs bg-green-50 text-green-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">🪄 Tekan padat</span>
                  <span class="text-xs bg-green-50 text-green-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">⚖️ Berat: 0.5-1kg</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <!-- Item 5 -->
          <div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center gap-4 md:gap-8">
            <div class="absolute left-4 md:left-1/2 w-4 h-4 bg-green-500 rounded-full border-4 border-white shadow-lg transform -translate-x-1/2 z-10"></div>
            
            <div class="ml-12 md:ml-0 md:w-1/2 md:pr-8 md:text-right order-2 md:order-1">
              <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 border-l-4 border-green-500 md:border-l-0 md:border-r-4 hover:-translate-y-1">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 md:justify-end">
                  <span class="text-3xl">🔒</span>
                  <span class="text-sm font-bold text-green-600 bg-green-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Langkah 5</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-800 mt-3">Penutupan & Pengedap</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-600 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
                  Tutup botol dengan rapat. Pastikan tiada ruang udara untuk memastikan ketahanan dan kekuatan ecobrick.
                </p>
                <div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2 md:justify-end">
                  <span class="text-xs bg-green-50 text-green-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">🔐 Tutup rapat</span>
                  <span class="text-xs bg-green-50 text-green-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">✅ Sedia guna</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="hidden md:block md:w-1/2 order-1 md:order-2"></div>
          </div>
          
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Bottom Call to Action -->
      <div class="mt-16 text-center">
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-green-600 to-emerald-600 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-12 text-white shadow-xl shadow-green-600/30">
          <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-3">
            🌱 Dari Sisa Ke Lestari
          </h2>
          <p class="text-green-100 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
            Setiap ecobrick yang dihasilkan adalah sumbangan kepada alam sekitar. 
            Mari bersama-sama membina masa depan yang lebih hijau!
          </p>
          <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center">
            <span class="bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm px-6 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">
              ♻️ 1 botol = 1 bata
            </span>
            <span class="bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm px-6 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">
              🌍 100% mesra alam
            </span>
            <span class="bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm px-6 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">
              🏗️ Binaan lestari
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
